Phase 2.2.2 Parallel Convolutional Decoder Training (MLX)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --batch_size BATCH_SIZE
                        Batch size for training
  --epochs EPOCHS       Total number of epochs to train
  --lr LR               Learning rate
  --save_steps SAVE_STEPS
                        Save a checkpoint every X steps
  --keep_last_k KEEP_LAST_K
                        Number of checkpoints to keep on disk. Oldest will be
                        deleted.
  --seed SEED           Random seed for shuffling chunks and data. Leave as
                        None for true randomness across runs.
  --z_dim Z_DIM         Dimension of the absolute truth anchor space
                        (z_target)
  --fusion_main_weight FUSION_MAIN_WEIGHT
                        Weight of the randomly selected primary embedding
                        logic
  --fusion_other_weight FUSION_OTHER_WEIGHT
                        Weight assigned to all other non-primary embeddings
  --config_file CONFIG_FILE
                        Path to JSON configuration file for Dataset & Models
  --out_dir OUT_DIR     Output directory for checkpoints
  --ckpt_prefix [CKPT_PREFIX]
                        Prefix for checkpoint folders
  --tokenizer_id TOKENIZER_ID
                        HuggingFace Tokenizer ID
  --continue            Automatically find and resume from the latest
                        checkpoint or emergency save
  --resume_from RESUME_FROM
                        Explicitly specify the path to a checkpoint directory
                        to resume from
  --warmup_steps WARMUP_STEPS
                        Learning rate linear warmup steps
  --data_dir DATA_DIR   Local cache directory for ModelScope downloads
  --keep_npz_cache      If set, downloaded .npz chunks are not deleted after
                        they are consumed
  --x1_weight X1_WEIGHT
                        Weight for x1-consistency loss (0=disabled)
  --snap_ce_weight SNAP_CE_WEIGHT
                        Weight for snap cross-entropy loss (0=disabled)
  --t_power T_POWER     Power for high-t sampling bias (1.0=uniform, 0.5=sqrt
                        bias)
  --noise_min NOISE_MIN
                        Minimum noise scale added to concept cloud during
                        training
  --noise_max NOISE_MAX
                        Maximum noise scale added to concept cloud during
                        training
  --cpu_batch_size CPU_BATCH_SIZE
                        Documents per super-batch
  --seq_len SEQ_LEN     Fixed sequence length for training and chunking
                        dataset samples
  --num_concept_blocks NUM_CONCEPT_BLOCKS
                        Number of highest-resonance concept blocks to retain
                        as anchors
  --encoder_ckpt ENCODER_CKPT
                        Path to Phase 1 encoder
  --vocab_size VOCAB_SIZE
  --embed_dim EMBED_DIM
  --hidden_dim HIDDEN_DIM
  --num_layers NUM_LAYERS
  --kernel_size KERNEL_SIZE
